  "title": "Accessibility checks",
  "area": "react",
  "summary": "Fix the four accessibility problems a routed React app most often ships with: a form control with no label, focus left behind after a route change, a skipped heading level, and links whose text means nothing on its own. You will then walk a page by keyboard and run an automated check, the evidence the Capstone asks for.",
